flowchart TD
    A[Surplus food identified] --> B[Create listing]
    B --> C{Expiry and storage checks}
    C -->|Fail| D[Reject / do not redistribute]
    C -->|Pass| E[Find active recipients]
    E --> F[Filter category and capacity]
    F --> G[Rank eligible recipients]
    G --> H{Recipient accepts?}
    H -->|No| E
    H -->|Yes| I[Arrange pickup]
    I --> J[Human handover check]
    J --> K[Mark delivered]
    K --> L[Update impact summary]
